OL,3,GNEWSARapper highlights the power of
OL,4,Ayouth clubs for BBC Children In Need
OL,5,
OL,6,FRapper DC3, real name Daniel Chenjerai,
OL,7,F19, is quietly watching ringside as a
OL,8,Fgroup of young people take part in
OL,9,Fboxing at a youth club in Battersea.
OL,11,FDozens of teenagers hit punchbags and
OL,12,Fdo burpees, and it's not long before he
OL,13,Ffinds himself taking part in a group
OL,14,Fwall sit.
OL,16,FNo-one gets away with standing still
OL,17,Fhere.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
